            <run>Source: NYC 311 Service Requests. Street maintenance requests created in 2025. Values show median administrative closure time in days for closed requests with valid, nonnegative closure durations. Status reflects the October 21, 2026 data snapshot. Administrative closure does not confirm physical repair completion. Unspecified borough records are retained for transparency.</run>
