              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='10'>Source: NYC Open Data — 311 Service Requests. Includes NYC DOT Street Condition requests created January 1–December 31, 2025, across Pothole, Cave-in, and Failed Street Repair categories. Data extracted October 21, 2026. Closure rate and unresolved status reflect the extraction-date snapshot. Closure time measures the interval between request creation and administrative closure; it does not confirm that a physical street repair was completed. Six records with negative closure durations are excluded from closure-time calculations.</run>
